{"id":"vol8-05","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-05/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":417.38,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":6.47,"text":"Now turn to section four on page seven. Section four.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.2],["turn",0.2,0.48],["to",0.48,0.68],["section",0.68,0.92],["four",0.92,1.46],["on",1.46,2.08],["page",2.08,2.38],["seven.",2.38,2.94],["Section",5.65,5.89],["four.",5.89,6.47]]},{"start":7.63,"end":13.41,"text":"You will hear part of a linguistics lecture about attempts to invent a universal language.","words":[["You",7.63,7.97],["will",7.97,8.13],["hear",8.13,8.37],["part",8.37,8.69],["of",8.69,8.85],["a",8.85,8.99],["linguistics",8.99,9.53],["lecture",9.53,9.99],["about",9.99,10.79],["attempts",10.79,11.21],["to",11.21,11.51],["invent",11.51,11.91],["a",11.91,12.19],["universal",12.19,12.75],["language.",12.75,13.41]]},{"start":14.27,"end":71.34,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40 on page seven. Now listen carefully","words":[["First",14.27,14.95],["you",14.95,15.19],["have",15.19,15.33],["some",15.33,15.49],["time",15.49,15.87],["to",15.87,16.13],["look",16.13,16.25],["at",16.25,16.37],["questions",16.37,16.67],["31",16.67,17.47],["to",17.47,17.71],["40",17.71,18.13],["on",18.13,18.81],["page",18.81,19.13],["seven.",19.13,19.63],["Now",70.22,70.54],["listen",70.54,70.9],["carefully",70.9,71.34]]},{"start":71.34,"end":73.86,"text":"and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["and",71.34,71.68],["answer",71.68,72.06],["questions",72.06,72.52],["31",72.52,73.28],["to",73.28,73.52],["40.",73.52,73.86]]},{"start":77.15,"end":82.59,"text":"Good morning. Welcome back to the series of linguistics lectures. Today I will be talking","words":[["Good",77.15,77.67],["morning.",77.67,77.99],["Welcome",78.41,78.59],["back",78.59,79.01],["to",79.01,79.21],["the",79.21,79.33],["series",79.33,79.61],["of",79.61,79.79],["linguistics",79.79,80.29],["lectures.",80.29,80.69],["Today",81.45,81.75],["I",81.75,82.11],["will",82.11,82.23],["be",82.23,82.37],["talking",82.37,82.59]]},{"start":82.59,"end":90.17,"text":"about the idea of inventing a universal language. What does that mean? Well, most human languages","words":[["about",82.59,82.87],["the",82.87,83.13],["idea",83.13,83.49],["of",83.49,83.77],["inventing",83.77,84.39],["a",84.39,84.57],["universal",84.57,85.07],["language.",85.07,85.63],["What",86.37,87.01],["does",87.01,87.15],["that",87.15,87.33],["mean?",87.33,87.53],["Well,",88.35,88.67],["most",88.99,89.29],["human",89.29,89.75],["languages",89.75,90.17]]},{"start":90.17,"end":97.27,"text":"were never invented, instead they evolved over time, and the result is, you know, they're irregular","words":[["were",90.17,90.43],["never",90.43,90.61],["invented,",90.61,91.25],["instead",91.57,92.05],["they",92.05,92.39],["evolved",92.39,93.17],["over",93.17,93.63],["time,",93.63,94.01],["and",94.55,94.77],["the",94.77,94.85],["result",94.85,95.15],["is,",95.15,95.39],["you",95.59,96.01],["know,",96.01,96.17],["they're",96.43,96.77],["irregular",96.77,97.27]]},{"start":97.27,"end":103.13,"text":"and difficult to learn. So for centuries people have dreamed of inventing a perfect universal","words":[["and",97.27,97.73],["difficult",97.73,98.09],["to",98.09,98.39],["learn.",98.39,98.65],["So",99.41,99.69],["for",99.69,99.81],["centuries",99.81,100.15],["people",100.15,100.57],["have",100.57,100.77],["dreamed",100.77,101.13],["of",101.13,101.33],["inventing",101.33,101.79],["a",101.79,101.87],["perfect",101.87,102.27],["universal",102.27,103.13]]},{"start":103.13,"end":109.69,"text":"language. The early invented languages that did exist were either created by priests to be used","words":[["language.",103.13,103.73],["The",104.51,104.83],["early",104.83,105.31],["invented",105.31,105.73],["languages",105.73,106.23],["that",106.23,106.59],["did",106.59,106.75],["exist",106.75,107.17],["were",107.17,107.53],["either",107.53,107.91],["created",107.91,108.27],["by",108.27,108.51],["priests",108.51,108.95],["to",108.95,109.37],["be",109.37,109.53],["used",109.53,109.69]]},{"start":109.69,"end":114.79,"text":"for religious purposes or developed to help establish trade between different nations.","words":[["for",109.69,109.85],["religious",109.85,110.19],["purposes",110.19,110.79],["or",110.79,111.63],["developed",111.63,111.97],["to",111.97,112.27],["help",112.27,112.47],["establish",112.47,113.05],["trade",113.05,113.49],["between",113.49,113.85],["different",113.85,114.25],["nations.",114.25,114.79]]},{"start":115.87,"end":120.75,"text":"Scholars have found evidence that around 900 languages have been invented over the centuries","words":[["Scholars",115.87,116.21],["have",116.21,116.45],["found",116.45,116.67],["evidence",116.67,117.13],["that",117.13,117.33],["around",117.33,117.67],["900",117.67,118.37],["languages",118.37,118.91],["have",118.91,119.33],["been",119.33,119.49],["invented",119.49,119.87],["over",119.87,120.15],["the",120.15,120.29],["centuries",120.29,120.75]]},{"start":120.75,"end":126.89,"text":"in various parts of the world. But the linguist Erika Ochrant believes that the exact figure","words":[["in",120.75,121.15],["various",121.15,121.49],["parts",121.49,121.83],["of",121.83,122.03],["the",122.03,122.11],["world.",122.11,122.47],["But",123.23,123.47],["the",123.47,123.59],["linguist",123.59,124.03],["Erika",124.03,124.59],["Ochrant",124.59,125.15],["believes",125.15,125.91],["that",125.91,126.13],["the",126.13,126.23],["exact",126.23,126.59],["figure",126.59,126.89]]},{"start":126.89,"end":132.59,"text":"is unclear because she suspects many of these languages are now lost. No record of them","words":[["is",126.89,127.11],["unclear",127.11,127.69],["because",127.69,128.17],["she",128.17,128.45],["suspects",128.45,128.85],["many",128.85,129.59],["of",129.59,129.75],["these",129.75,129.87],["languages",129.87,130.33],["are",130.33,130.71],["now",130.71,130.85],["lost.",130.85,131.29],["No",131.73,131.93],["record",131.93,132.25],["of",132.25,132.45],["them",132.45,132.59]]},{"start":132.59,"end":136.75,"text":"survives. The first really serious attempt to invent","words":[["survives.",132.59,132.99],["The",134.29,134.77],["first",134.77,134.97],["really",134.97,135.39],["serious",135.39,135.81],["attempt",135.81,136.25],["to",136.25,136.49],["invent",136.49,136.75]]},{"start":136.75,"end":142.97,"text":"language was made by William Spencer in the 17th century. Like so many others, he was frustrated","words":[["language",136.75,137.17],["was",137.17,137.43],["made",137.43,137.65],["by",137.65,137.83],["William",137.83,138.13],["Spencer",138.13,138.59],["in",138.59,139.07],["the",139.07,139.19],["17th",139.19,140.13],["century.",140.13,140.13],["Like",140.73,141.21],["so",141.21,141.45],["many",141.45,141.59],["others,",141.59,141.89],["he",142.25,142.35],["was",142.35,142.47],["frustrated",142.47,142.97]]},{"start":142.97,"end":148.87,"text":"by the irregularities in all existing languages. Accuracy was particularly important for Spencer","words":[["by",142.97,143.29],["the",143.29,143.45],["irregularities",143.45,144.19],["in",144.19,144.45],["all",144.45,144.63],["existing",144.63,145.05],["languages.",145.05,145.59],["Accuracy",146.51,147.05],["was",147.05,147.25],["particularly",147.25,147.73],["important",147.73,148.11],["for",148.11,148.51],["Spencer",148.51,148.87]]},{"start":148.87,"end":155.55,"text":"because he wrote books. His subject was science. As a result, he wanted to create a language where","words":[["because",148.87,149.49],["he",149.49,149.69],["wrote",149.69,149.87],["books.",149.87,150.25],["His",150.81,150.95],["subject",150.95,151.37],["was",151.37,151.55],["science.",151.55,151.93],["As",152.97,153.23],["a",153.23,153.29],["result,",153.29,153.65],["he",154.05,154.17],["wanted",154.17,154.35],["to",154.35,154.51],["create",154.51,154.77],["a",154.77,154.93],["language",154.93,155.25],["where",155.25,155.55]]},{"start":155.55,"end":162.23,"text":"words had only one meaning, so everyone would understand precisely what they meant. At first,","words":[["words",155.55,155.89],["had",155.89,156.15],["only",156.15,156.39],["one",156.39,156.73],["meaning,",156.73,157.19],["so",157.49,157.87],["everyone",157.87,158.43],["would",158.43,158.69],["understand",158.69,159.19],["precisely",159.19,159.73],["what",159.73,160.09],["they",160.09,160.27],["meant.",160.27,160.55],["At",161.55,161.93],["first,",161.93,162.23]]},{"start":162.23,"end":166.63,"text":"he thought the only way to do this was instead of using the usual letters of the alphabet,","words":[["he",162.23,162.51],["thought",162.51,162.67],["the",162.67,162.83],["only",162.83,162.99],["way",162.99,163.15],["to",163.15,163.27],["do",163.27,163.47],["this",163.47,163.71],["was",163.71,163.97],["instead",163.97,164.71],["of",164.71,164.87],["using",164.87,165.13],["the",165.13,165.35],["usual",165.35,165.69],["letters",165.69,165.99],["of",165.99,166.15],["the",166.15,166.25],["alphabet,",166.25,166.63]]},{"start":167.01,"end":175.19,"text":"a, b, c, and so on, he tried to substitute numbers for them. However, this attempt failed, mostly","words":[["a,",167.01,167.25],["b,",167.65,167.87],["c,",168.33,168.53],["and",168.81,168.85],["so",168.85,169.11],["on,",169.11,169.33],["he",169.99,170.09],["tried",170.09,170.27],["to",170.27,170.45],["substitute",170.45,170.79],["numbers",170.79,171.33],["for",171.33,171.63],["them.",171.63,171.81],["However,",172.67,172.99],["this",173.35,173.53],["attempt",173.53,173.91],["failed,",173.91,174.49],["mostly",174.79,175.19]]},{"start":175.19,"end":181.67,"text":"because he couldn't describe complex ideas in this way. So Spencer went back to using the","words":[["because",175.19,175.81],["he",175.81,176.17],["couldn't",176.17,176.61],["describe",176.61,177.13],["complex",177.13,177.69],["ideas",177.69,178.29],["in",178.29,178.51],["this",178.51,178.67],["way.",178.67,178.95],["So",179.83,180.09],["Spencer",180.09,180.55],["went",180.55,180.81],["back",180.81,181.11],["to",181.11,181.25],["using",181.25,181.47],["the",181.47,181.67]]},{"start":181.67,"end":187.05,"text":"alphabet, but he grouped words together in a different way. When his dictionary was published","words":[["alphabet,",181.67,182.01],["but",182.37,182.63],["he",182.63,182.75],["grouped",182.75,183.07],["words",183.07,183.43],["together",183.43,183.77],["in",183.77,184.01],["a",184.01,184.13],["different",184.13,184.33],["way.",184.33,184.65],["When",185.49,185.87],["his",185.87,186.07],["dictionary",186.07,186.35],["was",186.35,186.63],["published",186.63,187.05]]},{"start":187.05,"end":195.05,"text":"in 1668, the words weren't classified in alphabetical order. What he'd done was, he'd used the same","words":[["in",187.05,187.27],["1668,",187.27,188.33],["the",188.91,188.99],["words",188.99,189.23],["weren't",189.23,189.61],["classified",189.61,190.19],["in",190.19,190.41],["alphabetical",190.41,191.03],["order.",191.03,191.29],["What",192.21,192.45],["he'd",192.45,192.65],["done",192.65,192.85],["was,",192.85,193.13],["he'd",193.69,194.11],["used",194.11,194.61],["the",194.61,194.79],["same",194.79,195.05]]},{"start":195.05,"end":205.38,"text":"system with which plants were divided up into groups based on their type. Another important","words":[["system",195.05,195.49],["with",195.49,195.75],["which",195.75,196.05],["plants",196.05,196.55],["were",196.55,196.77],["divided",196.77,197.11],["up",197.11,197.31],["into",197.31,197.49],["groups",197.49,197.89],["based",197.89,198.37],["on",198.37,198.63],["their",198.63,198.77],["type.",198.77,199.13],["Another",204.56,204.8],["important",204.8,205.38]]},{"start":205.38,"end":211.02,"text":"attempt to invent a universal language was made by Ludwig Zamenoff, who was born in 1859.","words":[["attempt",205.38,205.7],["to",205.7,205.92],["invent",205.92,206.16],["a",206.16,206.34],["universal",206.34,206.74],["language",206.74,207.16],["was",207.16,207.42],["made",207.42,207.66],["by",207.66,207.84],["Ludwig",207.84,208.28],["Zamenoff,",208.28,208.94],["who",209.34,209.5],["was",209.5,209.64],["born",209.64,209.86],["in",209.86,210.02],["1859.",210.02,211.02]]},{"start":212.58,"end":218.12,"text":"Zamenoff's language reflects his own background. He grew up speaking Polish, English, French,","words":[["Zamenoff's",212.58,213.14],["language",213.14,213.42],["reflects",213.42,213.88],["his",213.88,214.12],["own",214.12,214.3],["background.",214.3,214.78],["He",215.34,215.48],["grew",215.48,215.66],["up",215.66,215.84],["speaking",215.84,216.12],["Polish,",216.12,216.58],["English,",217.0,217.32],["French,",217.94,218.12]]},{"start":218.12,"end":223.98,"text":"French, German and Russian. So, rather than create a completely new language, he mixed","words":[["French,",218.12,218.28],["German",218.68,218.9],["and",218.9,219.34],["Russian.",219.34,219.66],["So,",220.52,220.78],["rather",220.94,221.22],["than",221.22,221.4],["create",221.4,221.62],["a",221.62,221.74],["completely",221.74,222.16],["new",222.16,222.6],["language,",222.6,223.08],["he",223.66,223.8],["mixed",223.8,223.98]]},{"start":223.98,"end":230.6,"text":"together five or six existing European languages. Then, Zamanoff used an interesting technique","words":[["together",223.98,224.26],["five",224.26,224.68],["or",224.68,224.94],["six",224.94,225.26],["existing",225.26,225.88],["European",225.88,226.5],["languages.",226.5,227.08],["Then,",228.08,228.4],["Zamanoff",228.76,229.02],["used",229.02,229.3],["an",229.3,229.46],["interesting",229.46,229.94],["technique",229.94,230.6]]},{"start":230.6,"end":235.48,"text":"to help him develop his new language. He used it to write quite a few different songs","words":[["to",230.6,230.8],["help",230.8,230.98],["him",230.98,231.14],["develop",231.14,231.5],["his",231.5,231.74],["new",231.74,231.92],["language.",231.92,232.34],["He",232.92,233.18],["used",233.18,233.42],["it",233.42,233.56],["to",233.56,233.7],["write",233.7,233.92],["quite",233.92,234.26],["a",234.26,234.44],["few",234.44,234.66],["different",234.66,234.94],["songs",234.94,235.48]]},{"start":235.48,"end":241.14,"text":"and this made his work more enjoyable. He also thought that most European languages","words":[["and",235.48,236.0],["this",236.0,236.32],["made",236.32,236.66],["his",236.66,236.86],["work",236.86,237.08],["more",237.08,237.36],["enjoyable.",237.36,237.84],["He",238.82,239.24],["also",239.24,239.44],["thought",239.44,239.72],["that",239.72,239.92],["most",239.92,240.2],["European",240.2,240.56],["languages",240.56,241.14]]},{"start":241.14,"end":245.32,"text":"were too complicated, which meant that it was very difficult for people to learn","words":[["were",241.14,241.38],["too",241.38,241.5],["complicated,",241.5,242.02],["which",242.7,243.04],["meant",243.04,243.3],["that",243.3,243.46],["it",243.46,243.56],["was",243.56,243.68],["very",243.68,244.02],["difficult",244.02,244.36],["for",244.36,244.62],["people",244.62,244.86],["to",244.86,245.06],["learn",245.06,245.32]]},{"start":245.32,"end":251.52,"text":"them. Zamanov wanted to create a more simple language. So, for example, he had a single","words":[["them.",245.32,245.48],["Zamanov",246.3,246.86],["wanted",246.86,247.28],["to",247.28,247.48],["create",247.48,247.74],["a",247.74,247.88],["more",247.88,248.02],["simple",248.02,248.42],["language.",248.42,248.88],["So,",249.48,249.74],["for",249.92,250.06],["example,",250.06,250.44],["he",250.8,250.92],["had",250.92,251.08],["a",251.08,251.18],["single",251.18,251.52]]},{"start":251.52,"end":256.9,"text":"prefix that was used before adjectives or verbs to make them negative, which is obviously","words":[["prefix",251.52,251.98],["that",251.98,252.32],["was",252.32,252.46],["used",252.46,252.76],["before",252.76,253.06],["adjectives",253.06,253.72],["or",253.72,253.88],["verbs",253.88,254.28],["to",254.28,254.5],["make",254.5,254.72],["them",254.72,254.92],["negative,",254.92,255.42],["which",256.0,256.26],["is",256.26,256.44],["obviously",256.44,256.9]]},{"start":256.9,"end":261.86,"text":"much easier than English. Then, finally, he published a book introducing","words":[["much",256.9,257.14],["easier",257.14,257.56],["than",257.56,257.72],["English.",257.72,258.02],["Then,",259.18,259.54],["finally,",259.72,260.06],["he",260.58,260.68],["published",260.68,260.88],["a",260.88,261.08],["book",261.08,261.26],["introducing",261.26,261.86]]},{"start":261.86,"end":268.64,"text":"his language to the world in 1887. Unfortunately, like other invented languages, no one was","words":[["his",261.86,262.04],["language",262.04,262.34],["to",262.34,262.58],["the",262.58,262.7],["world",262.7,262.98],["in",262.98,263.22],["1887.",263.22,264.1],["Unfortunately,",265.02,265.62],["like",266.26,266.48],["other",266.48,266.76],["invented",266.76,267.2],["languages,",267.2,267.7],["no",268.14,268.32],["one",268.32,268.48],["was",268.48,268.64]]},{"start":268.64,"end":274.82,"text":"very interested at first. So again, Zamanov used an interesting approach. In order to","words":[["very",268.64,268.9],["interested",268.9,269.42],["at",269.42,269.62],["first.",269.62,269.92],["So",270.5,270.76],["again,",270.76,271.04],["Zamanov",271.34,271.78],["used",271.78,272.1],["an",272.1,272.26],["interesting",272.26,272.7],["approach.",272.7,273.2],["In",274.08,274.5],["order",274.5,274.66],["to",274.66,274.82]]},{"start":274.82,"end":279.66,"text":"To publicise the completed language, he made a list of everyone he knew and posted a letter","words":[["To",274.82,274.82],["publicise",274.82,275.42],["the",275.42,275.6],["completed",275.6,276.0],["language,",276.0,276.4],["he",276.92,277.06],["made",277.06,277.22],["a",277.22,277.36],["list",277.36,277.56],["of",277.56,277.72],["everyone",277.72,278.08],["he",278.08,278.4],["knew",278.4,278.66],["and",278.66,278.9],["posted",278.9,279.26],["a",279.26,279.48],["letter",279.48,279.66]]},{"start":279.66,"end":281.66,"text":"to all of them using the new language.","words":[["to",279.66,279.88],["all",279.88,280.18],["of",280.18,280.3],["them",280.3,280.46],["using",280.46,280.82],["the",280.82,281.04],["new",281.04,281.24],["language.",281.24,281.66]]},{"start":282.82,"end":286.94,"text":"Many people were surprised how easily they could understand it, and the language began","words":[["Many",282.82,283.1],["people",283.1,283.36],["were",283.36,283.52],["surprised",283.52,283.96],["how",283.96,284.28],["easily",284.28,284.64],["they",284.64,284.86],["could",284.86,285.0],["understand",285.0,285.5],["it,",285.5,285.74],["and",286.0,286.16],["the",286.16,286.26],["language",286.26,286.56],["began",286.56,286.94]]},{"start":286.94,"end":287.9,"text":"to attract attention.","words":[["to",286.94,287.08],["attract",287.08,287.4],["attention.",287.4,287.9]]},{"start":289.14,"end":293.92,"text":"Saminoff's language was never used all around the world as he had hoped, but still, it's","words":[["Saminoff's",289.14,289.66],["language",289.66,289.88],["was",289.88,290.14],["never",290.14,290.44],["used",290.44,290.88],["all",290.88,291.2],["around",291.2,291.44],["the",291.44,291.58],["world",291.58,291.84],["as",291.84,292.0],["he",292.0,292.1],["had",292.1,292.18],["hoped,",292.18,292.46],["but",292.92,293.1],["still,",293.1,293.36],["it's",293.76,293.92]]},{"start":293.92,"end":296.9,"text":"probably the most successful of all the invented languages.","words":[["probably",293.92,294.2],["the",294.2,294.42],["most",294.42,294.58],["successful",294.58,295.12],["of",295.12,295.46],["all",295.46,295.76],["the",295.76,295.94],["invented",295.94,296.36],["languages.",296.36,296.9]]},{"start":298.64,"end":303.76,"text":"In the 20th century, an Australian named Bruce Goldie tried something completely different.","words":[["In",298.64,299.2],["the",299.2,299.28],["20th",299.28,299.74],["century,",299.74,300.14],["an",300.58,300.72],["Australian",300.72,301.0],["named",301.0,301.48],["Bruce",301.48,301.76],["Goldie",301.76,302.3],["tried",302.3,302.58],["something",302.58,302.82],["completely",302.82,303.36],["different.",303.36,303.76]]},{"start":304.78,"end":310.38,"text":"Goldie thought that a universal language would be easier to use if the starting point for each word was a picture.","words":[["Goldie",304.78,305.34],["thought",305.34,305.6],["that",305.6,305.74],["a",305.74,305.84],["universal",305.84,306.28],["language",306.28,306.74],["would",306.74,306.96],["be",306.96,307.1],["easier",307.1,307.48],["to",307.48,307.66],["use",307.66,307.96],["if",307.96,308.2],["the",308.2,308.34],["starting",308.34,308.68],["point",308.68,309.02],["for",309.02,309.22],["each",309.22,309.44],["word",309.44,309.74],["was",309.74,309.98],["a",309.98,310.08],["picture.",310.08,310.38]]},{"start":311.36,"end":318.08,"text":"Goldie spent more than 20 years designing his new language and eventually published a book giving all the details in 1949.","words":[["Goldie",311.36,311.92],["spent",311.92,312.08],["more",312.08,312.32],["than",312.32,312.44],["20",312.44,312.78],["years",312.78,313.1],["designing",313.1,313.54],["his",313.54,313.74],["new",313.74,313.98],["language",313.98,314.36],["and",314.36,314.68],["eventually",314.68,315.08],["published",315.08,315.48],["a",315.48,315.7],["book",315.7,315.92],["giving",315.92,316.24],["all",316.24,316.54],["the",316.54,316.64],["details",316.64,317.06],["in",317.06,317.36],["1949.",317.36,318.08]]},{"start":319.42,"end":324.84,"text":"He also went on a lecture tour to promote it, but although the general public were often quite interested,","words":[["He",319.42,319.82],["also",319.82,320.04],["went",320.04,320.22],["on",320.22,320.32],["a",320.32,320.44],["lecture",320.44,320.64],["tour",320.64,320.88],["to",320.88,321.0],["promote",321.0,321.28],["it,",321.28,321.54],["but",322.06,322.3],["although",322.3,322.78],["the",322.78,322.96],["general",322.96,323.16],["public",323.16,323.5],["were",323.5,323.72],["often",323.72,323.96],["quite",323.96,324.2],["interested,",324.2,324.84]]},{"start":324.84,"end":329.56,"text":"interested, much to Goldie's disappointment, his language was ignored by all of the major","words":[["interested,",324.84,324.96],["much",325.44,325.76],["to",325.76,325.96],["Goldie's",325.96,326.34],["disappointment,",326.34,326.9],["his",327.36,327.48],["language",327.48,327.82],["was",327.82,328.06],["ignored",328.06,328.48],["by",328.48,328.78],["all",328.78,329.12],["of",329.12,329.22],["the",329.22,329.3],["major",329.3,329.56]]},{"start":329.56,"end":332.7,"text":"universities, despite frequent attempts to make them interested.","words":[["universities,",329.56,330.3],["despite",330.66,330.92],["frequent",330.92,331.44],["attempts",331.44,331.82],["to",331.82,332.02],["make",332.02,332.16],["them",332.16,332.28],["interested.",332.28,332.7]]},{"start":333.7,"end":337.34,"text":"It wasn't until the 1970s that his language had some success.","words":[["It",333.7,334.02],["wasn't",334.02,334.26],["until",334.26,334.5],["the",334.5,334.6],["1970s",334.6,335.68],["that",335.68,335.78],["his",335.78,335.96],["language",335.96,336.36],["had",336.36,336.64],["some",336.64,336.88],["success.",336.88,337.34]]},{"start":338.0,"end":342.46,"text":"This was in Canada in fact, where it was used to teach a group of disabled children in","words":[["This",338.0,338.34],["was",338.34,338.52],["in",338.52,338.7],["Canada",338.7,339.1],["in",339.1,339.32],["fact,",339.32,339.66],["where",339.86,339.98],["it",339.98,340.12],["was",340.12,340.28],["used",340.28,340.5],["to",340.5,340.72],["teach",340.72,340.86],["a",340.86,341.06],["group",341.06,341.28],["of",341.28,341.4],["disabled",341.4,341.72],["children",341.72,342.28],["in",342.28,342.46]]},{"start":342.46,"end":347.7,"text":"a hospital to read, and as a result, Goldie got some recognition for his work.","words":[["a",342.46,342.56],["hospital",342.56,343.0],["to",343.0,343.44],["read,",343.44,343.74],["and",344.26,344.66],["as",344.66,344.84],["a",344.84,344.9],["result,",344.9,345.32],["Goldie",345.56,345.96],["got",345.96,346.14],["some",346.14,346.44],["recognition",346.44,346.92],["for",346.92,347.3],["his",347.3,347.44],["work.",347.44,347.7]]},{"start":348.68,"end":350.44,"text":"So what can we say in conclusion?","words":[["So",348.68,349.2],["what",349.2,349.5],["can",349.5,349.68],["we",349.68,349.8],["say",349.8,350.02],["in",350.02,350.12],["conclusion?",350.12,350.44]]},{"start":351.12,"end":356.38,"text":"Well, the truth is, all attempts to create a universal language have failed, and there","words":[["Well,",351.12,351.68],["the",351.98,352.16],["truth",352.16,352.38],["is,",352.38,352.72],["all",352.98,353.2],["attempts",353.2,353.52],["to",353.52,353.76],["create",353.76,354.02],["a",354.02,354.14],["universal",354.14,354.52],["language",354.52,354.98],["have",354.98,355.18],["failed,",355.18,355.58],["and",355.82,356.12],["there",356.12,356.38]]},{"start":356.38,"end":357.78,"text":"are a number of reasons for this.","words":[["are",356.38,356.58],["a",356.58,356.7],["number",356.7,356.92],["of",356.92,357.08],["reasons",357.08,357.36],["for",357.36,357.64],["this.",357.64,357.78]]},{"start":358.5,"end":363.56,"text":"Firstly, most universal languages have been seen as rather technical and plain.","words":[["Firstly,",358.5,359.06],["most",359.64,359.86],["universal",359.86,360.34],["languages",360.34,360.88],["have",360.88,361.22],["been",361.22,361.42],["seen",361.42,361.7],["as",361.7,362.02],["rather",362.02,362.48],["technical",362.48,363.0],["and",363.0,363.18],["plain.",363.18,363.56]]},{"start":364.22,"end":367.46,"text":"They are not good at conveying emotions, so they've never been very popular.","words":[["They",364.22,364.38],["are",364.38,364.48],["not",364.48,364.6],["good",364.6,364.78],["at",364.78,364.88],["conveying",364.88,365.26],["emotions,",365.26,365.78],["so",365.84,366.02],["they've",366.02,366.18],["never",366.18,366.48],["been",366.48,366.76],["very",366.76,367.02],["popular.",367.02,367.46]]},{"start":368.36,"end":373.38,"text":"Another reason is the spread of English as a global language in the 20th century, particularly","words":[["Another",368.36,368.76],["reason",368.76,369.16],["is",369.16,369.4],["the",369.4,369.54],["spread",369.54,369.74],["of",369.74,369.88],["English",369.88,370.24],["as",370.24,370.5],["a",370.5,370.6],["global",370.6,370.9],["language",370.9,371.42],["in",371.42,371.58],["the",371.58,371.68],["20th",371.68,372.16],["century,",372.16,372.56],["particularly",372.98,373.38]]},{"start":373.38,"end":375.46,"text":"resulting from the film industry in Hollywood.","words":[["resulting",373.38,373.8],["from",373.8,374.12],["the",374.12,374.26],["film",374.26,374.54],["industry",374.54,374.92],["in",374.92,375.1],["Hollywood.",375.1,375.46]]},{"start":376.9,"end":381.16,"text":"Then, lastly, the type of people who invented the languages began to change.","words":[["Then,",376.9,377.5],["lastly,",377.5,378.1],["the",378.4,378.46],["type",378.46,378.76],["of",378.76,378.9],["people",378.9,379.12],["who",379.12,379.32],["invented",379.32,379.66],["the",379.66,379.84],["languages",379.84,380.18],["began",380.18,380.56],["to",380.56,380.76],["change.",380.76,381.16]]},{"start":381.9,"end":387.02,"text":"In the past, it had been academics, but more recently, the languages have often been created","words":[["In",381.9,382.06],["the",382.06,382.16],["past,",382.16,382.54],["it",382.58,382.68],["had",382.68,382.76],["been",382.76,382.92],["academics,",382.92,383.54],["but",384.06,384.28],["more",384.28,384.56],["recently,",384.56,384.94],["the",385.42,385.52],["languages",385.52,385.82],["have",385.82,386.22],["often",386.22,386.52],["been",386.52,386.7],["created",386.7,387.02]]},{"start":387.02,"end":391.42,"text":"by writers, usually for entertainment, so they haven't been taken seriously.","words":[["by",387.02,387.28],["writers,",387.28,387.78],["usually",388.14,388.52],["for",388.52,388.76],["entertainment,",388.76,389.28],["so",389.66,389.92],["they",389.92,390.28],["haven't",390.28,390.54],["been",390.54,390.7],["taken",390.7,390.94],["seriously.",390.94,391.42]]},{"start":392.82,"end":397.2,"text":"Alright, well, there's one other issue I'd like to consider, and that's the...","words":[["Alright,",392.82,393.38],["well,",393.76,393.9],["there's",394.2,394.5],["one",394.5,394.7],["other",394.7,394.86],["issue",394.86,395.12],["I'd",395.12,395.32],["like",395.32,395.44],["to",395.44,395.56],["consider,",395.56,395.98],["and",396.1,396.22],["that's",396.22,396.54],["the...",396.54,397.2]]},{"start":401.04,"end":402.96,"text":"That is the end of section 4.","words":[["That",401.04,401.34],["is",401.34,401.5],["the",401.5,401.64],["end",401.64,402.0],["of",402.0,402.18],["section",402.18,402.42],["4.",402.42,402.96]]},{"start":402.96,"end":406.62,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",402.96,403.9],["now",403.9,404.22],["have",404.22,404.58],["half",404.58,404.92],["a",404.92,405.12],["minute",405.12,405.38],["to",405.38,405.72],["check",405.72,406.04],["your",406.04,406.26],["answers.",406.26,406.62]]}]}